VOID FALL

It is an electro art made using HTML, In the plain black screen when you move through it, snow falls from where the cursor goes.

Features

When you move the cursor the snow or flakes drops.

Move faster and you get more of them.

Flakes are different sizes like tiny, few are big and they glow.

When you move the cursor very fast the snow settle down at the bottom.

